ealthy and the error rate is 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** I opened INC-0001 (SEV3, checkout-api) to record the change, and it paged on-call.\n\n**Approval to confirm:** v2.3.2 had never been healthy in production, so policy says this deploy needed change-manager approval. I submitted it expecting it to be sent to them first, but it went through right away. The tool gave no sign that anyone approved it. Please check with the change manager that this was signed off, or get sign-off after the fact. I've noted this in the incident.", "type": "text"}]}]}